<title>FINLAND: KEMIRA AGRO TO RENEW PLANT FOR FIM 90 MLN.</title>
<headline>KEMIRA AGRO TO RENEW PLANT FOR FIM 90 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish chemicals group Kemira Oy said in a statement on Wednesday its Agro unit would renew a fertiliser plant for 90 million markka.</p>
<p>&quot;Kemira Agro Oy will renew its Uusikaupunki fertiliser plant for 90 million markka,&quot; it said, adding that after the rebuild, the plant's structure would be the most diversified in Europe.</p>
<p>The project was due to be completed by end-1999, it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248, news@reuters.fi</p>
